###  Commits on Jun 24, 2026 

  * ####  [ Fix missing addition of idDelta when collecting cmap4 unicodes and mappings. ( ](/harfbuzz/harfbuzz/commit/22d6df2a1945467e828ae0dca0f48dc9d9278d09 "Fix missing addition of idDelta when collecting cmap4 unicodes and mappings. \(#6038\)

From the spec: The value c is the character code in question, and i is the segment index in which c appears. If the value obtained from the indexing operation is not 0 \(which indicates missingGlyph\), idDelta\[i\] is added to it to get the glyph index. The idDelta arithmetic is modulo 65536.") [ #6038 ](https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz/pull/6038) [ ) ](/harfbuzz/harfbuzz/commit/22d6df2a1945467e828ae0dca0f48dc9d9278d09 "Fix missing addition of idDelta when collecting cmap4 unicodes and mappings. \(#6038\)

From the spec: The value c is the character code in question, and i is the segment index in which c appears. If the value obtained from the indexing operation is not 0 \(which indicates missingGlyph\), idDelta\[i\] is added to it to get the glyph index. The idDelta arithmetic is modulo 65536.")

